*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-4\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-4]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fieldset-3\"> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-2\">이름 <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input autocomplete=\"given-name\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-2\" maxlength=\"100\" minlength=\"1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-2]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-3\">성 <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-3\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-3]\" required=\"required\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-email-1\">이메일 주소 <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-email-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][email-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"email\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-telephone-1\">전화번호 <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-telephone-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][telephone-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"tel\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"row\"> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-5\">도로명 주소</label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-5\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-5]\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-6\">우편번호 / 지역</label> <div class=\"input\"> <input class=\"form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-text-6\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][text-6]\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/> </div> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fieldset-1\"> <div class=\"clearfix\"> <p>서류 첨부: 문서는 PDF 형식으로 첨부해야 하며, 전체 파일 크기는 10MB를 초과할 수 없습니다. 첨부 파일의 업로드 및 전송은 본 양식을 제출할 때 시작됩니다.</p> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-1\">자기소개서 (PDF) <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input accept=\"application/pdf\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][fileupload-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"file\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-2\">이력서 (PDF) <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input accept=\"application/pdf\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-2\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][fileupload-2]\" required=\"required\" type=\"file\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-3\">증명서 / 자격증 (PDF) <span class=\"required\">*</span> </label> <div class=\"input\"> <input accept=\"application/pdf\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fileupload-3\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][fileupload-3]\" required=\"required\" type=\"file\"/> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-textarea-1\">문의 내용</label> <div class=\"input\"> <textarea class=\"xxlarge form-control\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-textarea-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][textarea-1]\"></textarea> </div> </div> </fieldset> <input aria-hidden=\"true\" data-id=\"1oKDC\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-1oKDC\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][1oKDC]\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\"/> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-fieldset-2\"> <div class=\"clearfix\"> <p>안내 사항: ZOLLER는 적합한 인재 선발을 위해 귀하가 제공한 정보를 저장합니다. 귀하의 개인정보는 일반 데이터 보호 규정(GDPR)에 따라 안전하게 저장 및 처리됩니다. 귀하의 정보는 엄격히 기밀로 유지되며 전자 전송 중 암호화됩니다. 제3자에게 제공되지 않습니다. 귀하의 프로필에 적합한 포지션을 찾지 못한 경우, 제출된 데이터는 늦어도 2개월 후에 삭제됩니다.</p> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"input checkbox\"> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"add-on form-check-label\" for=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-checkbox-1\"> <input name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][checkbox-1]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/><input class=\"add-on\" id=\"bewerbungsformular-4080-checkbox-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][checkbox-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/> <span>위 입력하신 개인정보가 영업 활동 및 문의 처리를 위해 사용되며 담당 영업소 또는 대리점에 전달되는 것에 동의합니다. 귀하는 사유를 밝히지 않고 언제든지 datenschutz@zoller.info로 데이터 처리에 대한 동의를 철회할 수 있습니다. <span class=\"required\">*</span> </span> </label> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <div class=\"actions\"> <nav class=\"form-navigation\"> <div class=\"btn-toolbar\" role=\"toolbar\"> <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\"> <span class=\"btn-group next submit\"> <button class=\"block-button\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[bewerbungsformular-4080][__currentPage]\" type=\"submit\" value=\"1\"> 지원서 제출 </button> </span> </div> </div> </nav> </div> </form>",
